{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skull8 is a small retro-inspired fantasy experiment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a procedurally generated labyrinth in search of eight mythical relics. Every screen hides traps, secrets, and subtle clues for the observant.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated labyrinth full of mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight relics of forgotten power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom 12\u00d712 Char Set text-graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards for competitive explorers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;Skull8 began as a way to introduce my 8-year-old son to programming. We started in BASIC on the Amstrad CPC, but soon ran into the limits of that old machine. So I ported the project to PC, expanded it, and now, it has found its way onto Steam.&gt;&gt;</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Queen's Promise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726040/93f74d977d393917dd7ac142b6b64897233cd8fb.jpg"},{"name":"Wizard\u2019s Wobbly Topper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726040/dfdf7f3a499c9bb77ff99c27f721a2ba65b53fe4.jpg"},{"name":"Betrayed & Bejeweled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726040/5f8ccd8a1da022210732310deb80f73d64d94762.jpg"},{"name":"Rusty Half-Sword","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726040/0274a23a30cce28ceebda8a6185a5ed8e8874126.jpg"},{"name":"Toot of Doom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726040/92eb6091396fb7806c8dc1998839a33aa502d7e2.jpg"},{"name":"Pokey Flame-Finger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726040/4b40d1fc040348531e926968097d2ba0388e3802.jpg"},{"name":"Shiny Pebble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstat